9</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">83,88</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5">Prova gratuita diventata a pagamento</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">7,99</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono">95,88</td></tr><tr class="border-t border-border"><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 font-semibold text-gray-900">Totale</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono font-semibold text-gray-900">32,95</td><td class="px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-right font-mono font-semibold text-gray-900">395,40</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted">Importi di esempio. Nessuno pesa da solo, insieme superano i 380 euro l''anno.</p></figure>'),
